Package: MyQuakyTools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Gene ID Mapping and Bioinformatics Annotations
Version: 0.1.0
Author: David Chisanga
Maintainer: David Chisanga <dchisanga05@gmail.com>
Description: A comprehensive suite of tools for downloading, parsing, and 
    mapping gene annotations across human and mouse databases (NCBI, Ensembl, 
    MGI, HGNC). Includes utilities for checking gene history, building ortholog 
    databases, and mapping MSigDB `.gmt` files.
